OL,3,GNEWSAWoman found not guilty after fatal
OL,4,Adog attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 78-year-old woman has been found not
OL,7,Fguilty of perverting the course of
OL,8,Fjustice following the death of a man in
OL,9,Fa dog attack.
OL,11,FJune Miles previously denied the charge
OL,12,Fin relation to the death of Anthony
OL,13,FHarrington at a house in Meriden,
OL,14,FSolihull, in November 2023.
OL,16,FHowever, she admitted owning a
OL,17,Fdangerously out-of-control dog in
OL,18,Fconnection with serious injuries
OL,19,Fsuffered by Mr Harrington's daughter,
OL,20,FWendy Harrington, at the same address.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
