OL,3,GNEWSAWoman found not guilty after fatal
OL,4,Adog attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday at Warwick Crown Court,
OL,7,FMiles was sentenced to 18 weeks'
OL,8,Fimprisonment, suspended for 20 months.
OL,9,FShe was also ordered to complete 100
OL,10,Fhours unpaid work and pay a victim
OL,11,Fsurcharge.
